  "prefLabel": "Rev 601.28 In-house work plan",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 601.28 “In-house work plan” means a written set of goals, objectives, processes, and timelines that the municipality intends to rely upon to perform revaluations, partial updates, or cyclical inspections.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Rev 600) #10581, eff 5-1-14; ss by #13916, eff 3-28-24 (formerly Rev 601.29) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Rev 600)",
